---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import HeaderV2 from '../../components/HeaderV2.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'June 6, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Qbits Energy"
  description="How Qbits Energy collects, uses, and protects your personal data when you visit qbitsenergy.com or use our services."
  canonical="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <HeaderV2 />

  <main id="main-content" class="pt-[104px] lg:pt-[120px]">
    <section class="section-padding bg-white">
      <div class="container-main max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-2">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          This Privacy Policy explains how Qbits Energy ("Qbits", "we", "us", or "our") collects,
          uses, discloses, and safeguards information when you visit
          <a href="https://qbitsenergy.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">qbitsenergy.com</a>,
          interact with our content, or contact us about our products and services.
        </p>

        <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-8">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">1. Information we collect</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">We collect information you give us directly:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600">
              <li><strong>Contact and inquiry data</strong> - name, email, phone, message content when you submit our contact form or write to us.</li>
              <li><strong>Partner / dealer application data</strong> - business name, location, contact details when you express interest in becoming an authorized service partner.</li>
              <li><strong>Service & warranty data</strong> - product serial numbers, installation address, and service history when you register a product or raise a service ticket.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mt-3">We also collect limited technical data automatically:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600">
              <li>IP address, browser type, device type, referring URL, and pages visited via standard server logs and analytics cookies.</li>
              <li>Usage data on which content you view, how you arrived, and how long you stay.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">2. How we use your information</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600">
              <li>To respond to inquiries, fulfill quote and demo requests, and provide product information.</li>
              <li>To process partner applications and onboard authorized service partners.</li>
              <li>To deliver service, warranty, and post-sale technical support.</li>
              <li>To improve the website, content, and product offerings based on aggregated usage data.</li>
              <li>To send transactional and product-related communications you have opted into.</li>
              <li>To comply with applicable Indian law including the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">3. How we share information</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">We do not sell personal data. We share data only:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600">
              <li>With our authorized service partners and channel dealers, when needed to deliver service in your region.</li>
              <li>With trusted vendors (hosting, analytics, CRM, email) under contractual confidentiality obligations.</li>
              <li>When required by law, regulatory order, or to protect the rights, property, or safety of Qbits, our customers, or the public.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">4. Cookies and tracking</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              We use first-party and third-party cookies for analytics, session management, and to remember your preferences. You can disable cookies in your browser settings; some site features may not function without them.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">5. Data retention</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              We retain personal data only as long as needed to provide our services, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce agreements. Inquiry records are typically retained for 36 months; warranty and service records for the duration of the warranty period plus 24 months.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">6. Your rights</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">Under applicable Indian and international data protection law, you may:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600">
              <li>Request access to the personal data we hold about you.</li>
              <li>Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
              <li>Request deletion ("right to be forgotten"), subject to legal retention requirements.</li>
              <li>Withdraw consent for marketing communications at any time.</li>
              <li>Lodge a complaint with the Indian Data Protection Board if you believe your rights have been violated.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mt-3">
              To exercise these rights, email <a href="mailto:service@qbitsenergy.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">service@qbitsenergy.com</a> with the subject line "Data Request".
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">7. Security</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              We use industry-standard technical and organizational measures (TLS in transit, access controls, audit logging) to protect personal data. No internet transmission is fully secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">8. Children</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              The site is not directed at children under 18. We do not knowingly collect data from minors. If you believe we have, contact us and we will delete it.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">9. Updates to this policy</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              We may revise this policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date above. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">10. Contact</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Qbits Energy<br />
              201, Anupam Square, Mahadev Chowk, Mota Varachha, Surat, Gujarat 394101, India<br />
              Email: <a href="mailto:service@qbitsenergy.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">service@qbitsenergy.com</a><br />
              Phone: <a href="tel:+919979192935" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">+91 99791 92935</a>
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
